	Do you ever look around at the ingredients available to you, the energy you have to give to the cooking process &#8212; or, as I recently explained to a medium-sized child shortly before I got uninvited from future family events, the amount of fudge you have left to give from your, uh, bucket of fudge &#8212; and decided to boil spaghetti, toss it with garlicky olive oil, and call it dinner?</p>
